ntor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Parcerias Estrat\u00e9gicas<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7858465 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7858465\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">para um Futuro de Sucesso<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac39fb9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ac39fb9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p>Na nossa empresa, acreditamos que as melhores solu\u00e7\u00f5es surgem atrav\u00e9s de colabora\u00e7\u00f5es estrat\u00e9gicas.<\/p><p>Trabalhamos lado a lado com parceiros que partilham os nossos valores e o compromisso com a excel\u00eancia, promovendo uma troca de conhecimentos e recursos que beneficia todas as partes envolvidas.<\/p><p>Para entregar as melhores solu\u00e7\u00f5es, possuimos uma estreita rela\u00e7\u00e3o com diversos parceiros, com o objetivo de dar \u00e0s empresas as melhores garantias de robustez e competitividade.<\/p><p>Se tem interesse em explorar uma potencial parceria connosco e juntar-se \u00e0 nossa rede de colabora\u00e7\u00e3o, preencha o formul\u00e1rio abaixo. Ficaremos felizes em conhecer a sua empresa e discutir como podemos construir juntos um futuro promissor.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3955a0d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3955a0d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0483538 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0483538\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/Templates-Redes-Sociais-23-1024x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-13249\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/Templates-Redes-Sociais-23-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/Templates-Redes-Sociais-23-300x300.p